ChessFlow Live includes Stockfish.js 19.0.1 Lite single-threaded WebAssembly engine files from the npm package `stockfish@19.0.1`.

Stockfish.js source and build: https://github.com/nmrugg/stockfish.js
Upstream Stockfish engine: https://github.com/official-stockfish/Stockfish
Full engine license text: NOTICE-STOCKFISH-LICENSE.txt

The JavaScript and WASM engine files are copied unmodified to public/engine/ by scripts/copy-engine.mjs after npm install. They are licensed under GPL-3.0.

The original flat chess-piece SVG artwork in src/pieces.jsx was created for ChessFlow Live and is licensed under GPL-3.0-only with this project. No third-party chess-piece assets are used.

Chess opening data in data/openings/*.tsv is from lichess-org/chess-openings (default branch master). As a collection of facts the dataset is public domain; insofar as copyright applies, it is released under CC0 1.0 Universal. Source: https://github.com/lichess-org/chess-openings
